# NOTICE — third-party tools, models and data

The framework code in this repository is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). It **wraps** external NLP
tools and **downloads** external models and corpora at setup time; no tool, model or corpus file
is redistributed here, and the frozen runs in `results/evidence/` hold per-sentence counts,
tables and figures, not corpus text. The licences of the tools, models and corpora are their
own and are listed below, because they differ — notably, GENTLE is non-commercial, the Penn
Treebank sample is for non-commercial use only, and RDRPOSTagger's learner is GPL.

